    {"name":"Equipos","item":[{"name":"Buscar","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{token}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/equipos?buscar=Dell","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["equipos"],"query":[{"key":"buscar","value":"Dell"}]}}}]},
    {"name":"Admin","item":[{"name":"Listar usuarios","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{token}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/admin/usuarios","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["admin","usuarios"]}}},{"name":"Auditoria","request":{"method":"GET","header":[{"key":"Authorization","value":"Bearer {{token}}"}],"url":{"raw":"{{baseUrl}}/admin/auditoria","host":["{{baseUrl}}"],"path":["admin","auditoria"]}}}]}
  ]
}
